46:27.240 --> 46:32.540
And finally, we brought all of this to bear on the ultimate test of artificial intelligence,

46:33.120 --> 46:37.760
the urgent demand for interventional equivalence over mere observational mimicry,

46:38.000 --> 46:41.920
and the necessity of the witness principle to pierce the chain of thought illusion.

46:42.240 --> 46:45.320
It is a breathtaking unified theory of cognition.

46:45.640 --> 46:46.360
It really is.

46:46.560 --> 46:49.840
And the overarching takeaway, the through line connecting all of this,

46:50.180 --> 46:53.020
is that understanding is not an accumulation of descriptions.

46:53.020 --> 46:58.000
You cannot reach understanding merely by piling up encyclopedic facts.

46:58.560 --> 47:01.000
Understanding is a living, breezing trajectory.

47:01.480 --> 47:06.080
It is the active, continuous process of reorganizing the differences that matter.

47:06.200 --> 47:08.020
It's about building a geometry of relevance

47:08.020 --> 47:12.340
